WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.238
Advanced settings should express a clear offer, not
replace it. This example is a code-based quantity

2
00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:12.866
break: two or more Coral notebooks receive ten
percent. In Offer, choose Discount Code and enter a

3
00:00:12.866 --> 00:00:19.884
unique test code. Select only Coral in Conditions and
set the two-unit reward in Rewards. We keep the

4
00:00:19.884 --> 00:00:25.342
campaign inactive throughout this recording, so the
example cannot change a live customer's purchase.

5
00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:32.314
In Review and launch, open Combination Settings.
Product, order and shipping discounts are independent

6
00:00:32.314 --> 00:00:39.082
categories. This example enables all three, but
Shopify must also accept the combination on the other

7
00:00:39.082 --> 00:00:45.849
discount. These checkboxes are not a guarantee that
every coupon stacks. Test the campaign alone first,

8
00:00:45.849 --> 00:00:52.617
then the intended codes separately and together. Do
not disable gift verification merely to hide a

9
00:00:52.617 --> 00:00:53.463
conflicting-code warning.

10
00:00:54.513 --> 00:01:01.230
Check the displayed shop timezone before selecting an
end date and time. It can differ from your computer's

11
00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:06.828
timezone. In Quantity and Sorting, zero means
unlimited discounted units on each qualifying line; it

12
00:01:06.828 --> 00:01:14.291
is not a cart purchase limit. In Limits, enable a
usage count and enter ten for this code example. A

13
00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:19.515
usage limit counts total redemptions, not one
redemption per customer. Minimum spending and maximum

14
00:01:19.515 --> 00:01:21.381
discount amount are different controls.

15
00:01:22.431 --> 00:01:29.723
Save inactive and reopen Review and launch. Confirm
the code, start and end times, three combination

16
00:01:29.723 --> 00:01:37.470
categories, quantity cap and usage limit. An enabled
campaign can still be outside its schedule, while a

17
00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:44.761
saved inactive draft never becomes eligible just
because its start date arrived. Before a real launch,

18
00:01:44.761 --> 00:01:51.141
test accepted and incompatible codes, removal and
reapplication, boundary times and the final checkout

19
00:01:51.141 --> 00:01:56.609
quantities. This walkthrough verifies saved settings,
not live redemptions or exhausted usage.
